  "recognized_text": "Hello? Hi. It's your tenant from apartment 5B. I'm afraid the hot water stopped again this morning. Again? Oh, I'm sorry. When did it happen before? This is the third time this month. The plumber came on Monday and last Friday, and both times it worked for a day or two, then stopped again. That's strange. Is it only in the mornings? Mostly, yes, which is a problem because I need to shower before work. I leave at 8:30. I see. The plumber can come again tomorrow at 8:00 or I can get the heater replaced on Saturday, but someone has to be at home from 9:00 to 1:00. The same fix hasn't worked twice, so I think a new heater is better. Saturday is fine. I'll be at home. Okay, I'll arrange it. A new heater on Saturday between 9:00 and 1:00. Thanks. And could you ask them to call me before they come? Of course. I'll give them your number. Bye for now.",
  "source_text": "Hello? Hi, it's your tenant from apartment five B. I'm afraid the hot water stopped again this morning. Again? I'm sorry. When did it happen before? This is the third time this month. The plumber came on Monday and last Friday, and both times it worked for a day or two, then stopped again. That's strange. Is it only in the mornings? Mostly, yes, which is a problem, because I need to shower before work. I leave at eight thirty. I see. The plumber can come again tomorrow at eight. Or I can get the heater replaced on Saturday, but someone has to be at home from nine to one. The same fix hasn't worked twice, so I think a new heater is better. Saturday is fine. I'll be at home. Okay, I'll arrange it. A new heater on Saturday, between nine and one. Thanks. And could you ask them to call me before they come? Of course. I'll give them your number. Bye for now.",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi, it's your tenant from apartment five B. I'm afraid the hot water stopped again this morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Again? I'm sorry. When did it happen before?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "This is the third time this month. The plumber came on Monday and last Friday, and both times it worked for a day or two, then stopped again."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's strange. Is it only in the mornings?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Mostly, yes, which is a problem, because I need to shower before work. I leave at eight thirty."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I see. The plumber can come again tomorrow at eight. Or I can get the heater replaced on Saturday, but someone has to be at home from nine to one."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "The same fix hasn't worked twice, so I think a new heater is better. Saturday is fine. I'll be at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it. A new heater on Saturday, between nine and one."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Thanks. And could you ask them to call me before they come?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. I'll give them your number. Bye for now."
    }
  ],
